    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 623570500292232469, guid: c5d26d9f9395dfd4a875f483172f25c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<b><size=42><align=center>DOCKS</align></size></b>\n\nSome ships are
        crewed by smugglers. They will sell you <b>extremely valuable or rare goods</b>
        once they trust you. Build trust by spending time on ships and buying their
        goods. \n\nYou can test your luck for smuggled goods with a dice game. If
        you <color=#00aa00><b>win</b></color> against the crew, you pay half price.
        If you  <color=#aa0000><b>lose</b></color>, you forfeit the half price."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 623570500292232469, guid: c5d26d9f9395dfd4a875f483172f25c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_lineSpacing
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 623570500292232469, guid: c5d26d9f9395dfd4a875f483172f25c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_paragraphSpacing
      value: -50
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1108484171940093416, guid: c5d26d9f9395dfd4a875f483172f25c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<b><size=42><align=center>DOCKS</align></size></b>\n\nShips have <b>rare
        and unusual</b> goods for sale you can't buy at the shops. Ships dock for
        a few days, then go to sea to visit other lands and restock. \n\nIf a specific
        ship you want to visit isn't docked, check again another day.\n\nLook around
        with <b>Left/Right/Up/Down</b>. \n\n\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1108484171940093416, guid: c5d26d9f9395dfd4a875f483172f25c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_lineSpacing
